## Phase 3 Accomplishments: Requisitions & Inter-Store Transfers

1. **Backend Requisition & Transfer Endpoints**:
   - [`server/routes/transfers.ts`](file:///d:/dev/acme/acme-erp/server/routes/transfers.ts)
   - Mounted in [`server/routes.ts`](file:///d:/dev/acme/acme-erp/server/routes.ts).
   - Requisition lifecycle endpoints: `POST /inventory/requisitions`, `GET /inventory/requisitions`, `GET /inventory/requisitions/:id`, `PATCH /inventory/requisitions/:id/approve`, `PATCH /inventory/requisitions/:id/reject`.
   - Two-Phase Transfer lifecycle endpoints: `POST /inventory/transfers`, `GET /inventory/transfers`, `GET /inventory/transfers/:id`, `PATCH /inventory/transfers/:id/dispatch`, `PATCH /inventory/transfers/:id/receive`, `PATCH /inventory/transfers/:id/cancel`.

2. **Two-Phase Transfer Mechanics**:
   - **Phase 1 (Dispatch)**: Reduces batch stock in source store via `TRANSFER_OUT` movement log, sets transfer status to `in_transit`, and records dispatch timestamp & user.
   - **Phase 2 (Receive)**: Increases batch stock in destination store via `TRANSFER_IN` movement log, sets status to `received`, and updates linked requisition item fulfilled quantities.

3. **Store Indents (Requisitions) UI**:
   - [`src/routes/_authenticated/inventory/requisitions/index.tsx`](file:///d:/dev/acme/acme-erp/src/routes/_authenticated/inventory/requisitions/index.tsx)
   - Filterable list of store indents with status badges (`Submitted`, `Approved`, `Partially Fulfilled`, `Fulfilled`, `Rejected`).
   - Interactive modal to submit new store indents and approve/reject pending requests.

4. **Stock Transfers UI**:
   - [`src/routes/_authenticated/inventory/transfers/index.tsx`](file:///d:/dev/acme/acme-erp/src/routes/_authenticated/inventory/transfers/index.tsx)
   - Transfer queue showing Source Store, Destination Store, status badges, and action buttons.
   - Transfer creation modal with live batch stock picker for the selected source store.
   - One-click Dispatch and Receive verification dialogs.

5. **Sidebar Navigation Update**:
   - [`src/components/Shell.tsx`](file:///d:/dev/acme/acme-erp/src/components/Shell.tsx)
   - Added links for **Store Indents** (`/inventory/requisitions`) and **Stock Transfers** (`/inventory/transfers`) under "Inventory & Store".

